msgstr "一款40x53mm镖形榴弹，弹头内装着115颗17格令重的飞镖。"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "40x53mm M430A1 HEDP"
msgid_plural "40x53mm M430A1 HEDP"
msgstr[0] "40x53mm M430A1 高爆两用弹"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '40x53mm M430A1 HEDP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high velocity 40x53mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can "
"penetrate 3 inches of steel armor and fragmentation of the projectile body "
"also makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr "一款高初速的40x53mm 高爆两用榴弹。它能够击穿3英寸厚的钢板，爆炸产生的大量破片使它也能作为反步兵弹药使用。"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
