msgstr "一种长着羽毛的会飞的爬行动物，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。长着较短的翅膀和颜色鲜艳的大嘴。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化棘龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Spinosaurus bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive therapod with a huge fin on its back and a crocodile-like snout.  "
"It is silver from armor plating and cybernetics crackle all over its body.  "
"There seems to be a laser rifle mounted to its head.  It scans endlessly for"
" its next target."
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的兽脚类恐龙，背上有巨大的鳍，长着像鳄鱼的喙。它浑身上下装满了闪亮的盔甲，生化插件在它身上噼啪作响。头上好像装了一把激光步枪。它正在不停地寻找下一个目标。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"TARGET ACQUIRED.\""
msgstr "\"目标已确认。\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "TARGET ACQUIRED.  *beeeeeeeeep*.  OUT OF AMMO."
msgstr "\"目标已确认。\"*哔————*\"弹药已耗尽。\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal Dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal Dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸双脊龙"

#. ~ Description for fungal Dilophosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a predator dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on "
"its head, fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other "
"orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh with a "
"colorful frill of interwoven mushrooms."
msgstr ""
"一具蹒跚而行的中型恐龙尸体，牙齿很锋利，头部有两个突出的骨冠，真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，在一圈五颜六色的蘑菇缠绕下，被霉菌覆盖的躯体还在蹒跚而行。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal zombie dragon"
msgid_plural "fungal zombie dragons"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸角鼻龙"

#. ~ Description for fungal zombie dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once an enormous, scaly dinosaur studded with bony spikes with colorful "
"horns, fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, "
