#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a gigantic, long-necked, four-legged plant eating dinosaur with longer "
"forelegs and spiked tail protected by natural bone armor, fungal tendrils "
"now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together an "
"enormous shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr ""
"曾经是一只巨型四足食草恐龙，具有极长的颈部与尾巴，尾巴有尖刺，有天然的骨甲保护。真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，被霉菌覆盖的巨大躯体还在蹒跚而行。"

