msgid "You misprogram the manhack; it's hostile!"
msgstr "你没设好这台飞锯无人机的程序，它现在变成敌对的了！"

#. ~ Description for inactive manhack
#. ~ Description for inactive hack
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
