msgstr "你有宾至如归的感觉。"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Vault Air'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "This smells like home."
msgstr "闻起来有种到家的感觉。"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Vault Air'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Time to go."
msgstr "该走了。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Freeze"
msgstr "渐冻"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Slow Freeze'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The cold slows down your foes."
msgstr "寒冷减慢了你的敌人。"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can feel Mother Nature welcoming you, revitalizing your body and calming"
" the natural fauna around you."
msgstr "你能感受到自然之母正欢迎着你的到来，你的身体恢复活力，四周的野生动物也平静下来。"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "A warm embrace surrounds you, like that of a mother with her child."
msgstr "一股温暖的怀抱围绕着你，如同母亲抱着她的孩子一般。"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your commune with Mother Nature fades."
msgstr "你同自然之母的联结逐渐消散。"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Dragon Terror'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You are uneasy and fearful from a Dragon's mighty presence"
msgstr "你对巨龙的强大存在感到不安和恐惧。"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You are filled with the power of Dragons."
msgstr "你的体内充满了巨龙的力量。"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you are filled with the power of Dragons!"
msgstr "伴随着一声刺耳的咆哮，你的体内充满了巨龙的力量！"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The Draconic energy fades from within you."
msgstr "巨龙的力量从你体内消失了。"

