#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Cropland"
msgstr "耕地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Generally tilled land used to grow row crops.  Boundaries follow the shape "
"of the fields and include associated buildings (e.g., barns).  This category"
" also includes turf farms that grow sod."
msgstr "通常用来种庄稼的耕地。边界遵循田野的形状，包括相关建筑物（如谷仓）。这一类别还包括种植草皮的草场。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Pasture"
msgstr "牧场"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fields and associated facilities (barns and other outbuildings) used for "
"animal grazing and for the growing of grasses for hay."
msgstr "用于动物放牧和种植干草的农田和相关设施（包括谷仓和其他附属建筑）。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#: lang/json/overmap_terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Forest"
msgstr "森林"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Areas where tree canopy covers at least 50% of the land.  Both coniferous "
"and deciduous forests belong to this class."
msgstr "至少50%以上土地被树冠覆盖的区域。针叶林和落叶林都属于这一类。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgstr "非森林湿地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."
msgstr "符合环保部湿地（1：12000）湿地分类标准类型为 4、7、8、12、23、18、20、21 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "矿区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes sand and gravel pits, mines and quarries.  The boundaries extend to"
" the edges of the site’s activities, including on-site machinery, parking "
"lots, roads and buildings."
msgstr "包括砂石坑、矿山和采石场。边界延伸至开采活动的边缘，包括现场机械、停车场、道路和建筑物。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Open Land"
msgstr "旷地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Vacant land, idle agriculture, rock outcrops, and barren areas.  Vacant land"
" is not maintained for any evident purpose and it does not support large "
"plant growth."
msgstr "空置土地、闲置农场、岩石区和贫瘠地区。空置土地没有任何明显的用途，也无法生长大型植物。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Participation Recreation"
msgstr "公共娱乐场所"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Facilities used by the public for active recreation.  Includes ball fields, "
"tennis courts, basketball courts, athletic tracks, ski areas, playgrounds, "
"and bike paths plus associated parking lots.  Primary and secondary school "
"recreational facilities are in this category, but university stadiums and "
"arenas are considered Spectator Recreation.  Recreation facilities not open "
"to the public such as those belonging to private residences are mostly "
"labeled with the associated residential land use class not participation "
"recreation.  However, some private facilities may also be mapped."
msgstr ""
"供公众活动娱乐的设施。包括球场、网球场、篮球场、田径场、滑雪场、运动场和自行车道以及相关停车场。中小学娱乐设施属于这一类，但大学体育场和竞技场被视为观众娱乐场所。不面向公众开放的娱乐设施，如属于私人住宅的娱乐设施，大多标记为对应住宅区而非标注为此类。然而，一些私人设施也可能被标注为此类。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Spectator Recreation"
msgstr "观众娱乐场所"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"University and professional stadiums designed for spectators as well as "
"zoos, amusement parks, drive-in theaters, fairgrounds, race tracks and "
"associated facilities and parking lots."
msgstr "专为观众设计的大学和专业体育场，以及动物园、游乐园、露天电影院、露天游乐场、赛马场、相关设施和停车场。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Water-Based Recreation"
msgstr "水上娱乐场所"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Swimming pools, water parks, developed freshwater and saltwater sandy beach "
"areas and associated parking lots.  Also included are scenic areas "
"overlooking lakes or other water bodies, which may or may not include access"
" to the water (such as a boat launch).  Water-based recreation facilities "
"related to universities are in this class.  Private pools owned by "
"individual residences are usually included in the Residential category.  "
"Marinas are separated into code 29."
msgstr ""
"游泳池、水上公园、已开发的淡水和咸水沙滩区以及相关的停车场。此外，还包括可俯瞰湖泊或其他水体的风景区，这些水域可能包括也可能不包括水上通道（如船只下水处）。与大学有关的水上娱乐设施在此类别内。私人住宅拥有的私人游泳池通常包括在住宅类别中。游艇停靠区被单独分类为"
" 29。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Multi-Family Residential"
msgstr "多户住宅区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Duplexes (usually with two front doors, two entrance pathways, and sometimes"
" two driveways), apartment buildings, condominium complexes, including "
"buildings and maintained lawns.  Note: This category was difficult to assess"
" via photo interpretation, particularly in highly urban areas."
msgstr ""
"复式住宅（通常有两个正门、两条入口通道，有时还有两条车道）、公寓楼、公寓综合楼，包括建筑物和公共花园。注：这一类别很难通过卫星图像分辨，特别是在高度城市化的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "High Density Residential"
msgstr "高密度城区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on smaller than 1/4 acre lots.  See notes below for details on "
"Residential interpretation."
msgstr "单位住宅占地面积小于1/4英亩的房屋。住宅解释详情见下文注释。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Medium Density Residential"
msgstr "中密度城区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/4 - 1/2 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr "单位住宅占地面积在1/4 - 1/2英亩的房屋。住宅解释详情见下文注释。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Low Density Residential"
msgstr "低密度城区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/2 - 1 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr "单位住宅占地面积在1/2 - 1英亩的房屋。住宅解释详情见下文注释。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Saltwater Wetland"
msgstr "盐水湿地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."
msgstr "符合环保部湿地（1：12000）湿地分类标准类型为 11、27 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "商业区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Malls, shopping centers and larger strip commercial areas, plus neighborhood"
" stores and medical offices (not hospitals).  Lawn and garden centers that "
"do not produce or grow the product are also considered commercial."
msgstr "商店、购物中心和大型商业区，以及社区商店和社区诊所（不是医院）。与生产或种植无关的的草坪和中心花园也被视为商业区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Industrial"
msgstr "工业区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Light and heavy industry, including buildings, equipment and parking areas."
msgstr "轻工业和重工业，包括建筑物、设备和停车场。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Transitional"
msgstr "过渡区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Open areas in the process of being developed from one land use to another "
"(if the future land use is at all uncertain).  Formerly identified as Urban "
"Open."
msgstr "处于从一种土地用途向另一种土地用途转换的开发过程中的区域（当未来土地用途未定时）。以前被认定为城市开放区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Transportation"
msgstr "交通运输区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Airports (including landing strips, hangars, parking areas and related "
"facilities), railroads and rail stations, and divided highways (related "
"facilities would include rest areas, highway maintenance areas, storage "
"areas, and on/off ramps).  Also includes docks, warehouses, and related "
"land-based storage facilities, and terminal freight and storage facilities."
"  Roads and bridges less than 200 feet in width that are the center of two "
"differing land use classes will have the land use classes meet at the center"
" line of the road (i.e., these roads/bridges themselves will not be "
"separated into this class)."
msgstr ""
"机场（包括停机坪、机库、停车场和相关设施）、铁路和火车站以及全封闭式高速公路（相关设施包括休息区、公路维护区、储存区和进出匝道）。还包括码头、仓库和相关陆基存储设施，以及码头货运和存储设施。位于两个不同土地用途编码地区之间宽度小于200英尺的道路和桥梁将按照其中心所在土地用途进行编码（即，这些道路/桥梁本身不会被划分为该类别）。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Waste Disposal"
msgstr "废物处理区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Landfills, dumps, and water and sewage treatment facilities such as pump "
"houses, and associated parking lots.  Capped landfills that have been "
"converted to other uses are coded with their present land use."
msgstr "垃圾填埋场、垃圾场、水泵房、污水处理设施及其停车场。已转换为其他用途的封顶堆填区将按照其当前的土地用途编码。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 and 22."
msgstr "符合环保部湿地（1：12000）湿地分类标准类型为 9、22 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Cranberry bog"
msgstr "蔓越莓沼泽"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Both active and recently inactive cranberry bogs and the sandy areas "
"adjacent to the bogs that are used in the growing process.  Impervious "
"features associated with cranberry bogs such as parking lots and machinery "
"are included.  Modified from DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."
msgstr ""
"包括活跃的及非活跃的蔓越莓沼泽，以及沼泽增长时所吞并的临近沙地。蔓越莓沼泽周围的停车场和大型机械等所处的防水地貌也包含在内。修改自环保部湿地（1：12000）"
" 湿地分类标准类型为 5 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Powerline/Utility"
msgstr "电力公共设施"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powerline and other maintained public utility corridors and associated "
"facilities, including power plants and their parking areas."
msgstr "电线和其他维护电力公用设施及相关设施，包括发电厂及其停车场。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
msgstr "盐水沙滩"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17 and 19"
msgstr "符合环保部湿地（1：12000）湿地分类标准类型为 1、2、3、6、10、13、17、19 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Golf Course"
msgstr "高尔夫球场"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the greenways, sand traps, water bodies within the course, "
"associated buildings and parking lots.  Large forest patches within the "
"course greater than 1 acre are classified as Forest (class 3).  Does not "
"include driving ranges or miniature golf courses."
msgstr "包括绿道、沙井、球场内水域、相关建筑和停车场。区域范围内超过1英亩的大片森林被归类为森林（3类）。不包括驾驶场或迷你高尔夫球场。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Marina"
msgstr "游艇停靠区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Include parking lots and associated facilities but not docks (in class 18)"
msgstr "包括停车场和相关设施，但不包括码头（18类）。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Urban Public/Institutional"
msgstr "城市公共机构区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lands comprising schools, churches, colleges, hospitals, museums, prisons, "
"town halls or court houses, police and fire stations, including parking "
"lots, dormitories, and university housing.  Also may include public open "
"green spaces like town commons."
msgstr ""
"包括学校、教堂、学院、医院、博物馆、监狱、市政厅或法院大楼、警察局和消防站的土地，包括停车场、宿舍和大学。也可能包括公共开放的绿地，如城镇公共场所。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#: lang/json/start_location_from_json.py
msgid "Cemetery"
msgstr "墓地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the gravestones, monuments, parking lots, road networks and "
"associated buildings."
msgstr "包括墓碑、纪念碑、停车场、公路网和相关建筑。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Orchard"
msgstr "果园"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Fruit farms and associated facilities."
msgstr "果园和相关设施。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Nursery"
msgstr "苗圃区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Greenhouses and associated buildings as well as any surrounding maintained "
"lawn.  Christmas tree (small conifer) farms are also classified as "
"Nurseries."
msgstr "温室和相关建筑以及周围维护的草坪。圣诞树（小针叶树）农场也被归类为苗圃。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Forested Wetland"
msgstr "森林湿地"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25 and 26."
msgstr "符合环保部湿地（1：12000）湿地分类标准类型为 14、15、16、24、25、26 的地区。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Very Low Density Residential"
msgstr "极低密度住宅区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on > 1 acre lots and very remote, rural housing.  See notes below "
"for details on Residential interpretation."
msgstr "单位住宅占地面积超过1英亩的住宅区和位于远郊的住宅区。住宅解释详情见下文注释。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Junkyard"
msgstr "废品场"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the storage of car, metal, machinery and other debris as well as "
"associated buildings as a business."
msgstr "用于储存包括废旧汽车、金属、机械及其他建筑垃圾的地方，以及相关商业建筑。"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Brushland/Successional"
msgstr "灌丛演替区"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Predominantly (> 25%) shrub cover, and some immature trees not large or "
"dense enough to be classified as forest.  It also includes areas that are "
"more permanently shrubby, such as heath areas, wild blueberries or mountain "
"laurel."
msgstr "主要地区（>25%）被灌木覆盖，有些尚为成年或不够茂密的幼树，不能归类为森林。还包括一些永久性的灌丛地带，如荒地、野生蓝莓丛或山月桂丛。"

