" around you.  Not wanting to get in the way of angry looking protesters, you"
" took an old neglected side road, only to find yourself low on gas in a "
"truly deserted place.  Couldn't this all just happen before you finished "
"your work?"
msgstr ""
"你受雇于一家大公司，直接到恼人的客户家中提供上门服务，并为他们的设备排除故障。 "
"在你费尽心力完成更换\"wifi线缆\"后，你终于能够回到你的公司，在回去的路上你注意到周围发生的混乱。你不想被卷入那些看起来很愤怒的抗议者，就走了一条被忽视的老路，结果发现自己身处一处十分荒芜的地方，而且燃油不足。为什么这一切就不能在你去完成工作之前发生呢？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "校车司机"

#. ~ Profession (male Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
" the chaos happening around you.  By the time you arrive at the station, all"
" the brats look like zombies, so you took a long detour to safety, only to "
"find yourself in a different place.  At last you have been freed of the "
"hellish noises they release, but new ones are on the merge."
msgstr ""
"你靠把吵闹的孩子送到他们的学校为生，你每次送人时都希望，每个孩子能为你着想，不要破坏座位或窗户。在你去接第一排孩子的路上，你开始注意到周围发生的混乱。当你到达车站的时候，所有的孩子看起来都像丧尸一样，所以你绕了很长一段路寻找安全的地方，却发现自己身处不同的地方。至少你已经从它们释放出的地狱般的噪音中解脱出来了，然而新的噪音正要出现。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "校车司机"

#. ~ Profession (female Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
