#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "截击交警"

#. ~ Profession (male Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"作为一名执勤警官，你接到呼叫，正准备驾驶巡逻车前往抢劫现场。当你到达报警现场后，很快就发现你才是那个需要救援的人。你很幸运地保住了小命，开着警车逃走了。但再也没有人在收音机里回应你了。当这个徽章所代表的政府可能已经不复存在时，谁会尊重你的权威呢？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "截击交警"

#. ~ Profession (female Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"作为一名执勤警官，你接到呼叫，正准备驾驶巡逻车前往抢劫现场。当你到达报警现场后，很快就发现你才是那个需要救援的人。你很幸运地保住了小命，开着警车逃走了。但再也没有人在收音机里回应你了。当这个徽章所代表的政府可能已经不复存在时，谁会尊重你的权威呢？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "民兵"

#. ~ Profession (male Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"你早就为这一刻做好了准备。你和一群爱国同胞一起，在树林里建立了一个藏身处，从那里驾驶一辆临时拼凑的皮卡四处打劫。最后一次行动不是很顺利，你成了你以前的战友中活下来的最后一人。你现在每一次呼吸都是对这个注定要毁灭的残酷世界的反抗。不要让你心中的希望之火熄灭。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "民兵"

#. ~ Profession (female Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"你早就为这一刻做好了准备。你和一群爱国同胞一起，在树林里建立了一个藏身处，从那里驾驶一辆临时拼凑的皮卡四处打劫。最后一次行动不是很顺利，你成了你以前的战友中活下来的最后一人。你现在每一次呼吸都是对这个注定要毁灭的残酷世界的反抗。不要让你心中的希望之火熄灭。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "公园护林员"

#. ~ Profession (male Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
"作为一名公园护林员，你日常做的大部分工作就是维护公园，教人们如何不在森林里起火，四处巡逻，以及在你日常工作清单上打勾。在到达一个荒废的营地之后，你发现了幸存者留下的纸条，你听从了他们的警告，并在你的休息站中收拾了一些物资，并和你的皮卡一起，勉强在休息站沦陷之前离开了。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "公园护林员"

#. ~ Profession (female Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
