#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Traceur"
msgstr "跑酷哥"

#. ~ Profession (Traceur) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground."
"  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr "你已经练了很多年的跑酷，世界就是你的游乐场。当你说跑步是你的生命时并没有撒谎。这很好，因为现在世界已经终结了，你正在为你的生存而奔跑。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Traceuse"
msgstr "跑酷妹"

#. ~ Profession (Traceuse) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground."
