#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Flamethrower Operator"
msgstr "喷火兵"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Flamethrower Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain alien invasive "
"species through judicious use of fire.  After getting separated from your "
"squad, your priorities have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr "为了应对这次爆发，你们被派去通过巧妙地使用火焰来控制外星入侵物种。在与你的队伍失散后，你的首要任务已经转移到基本生存上了。"

