#. ~ Profession (male Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the aliens.  As far as you"
" can tell, you're one of the last active operators in this hellhole."
msgstr "你是精英中的精英，是军队的神话。这也就是为什么你的战友基本都挂了，而你还活着的原因。据你所知，你是这个地狱里最后活跃的操作员之一。"

