#. ~ Profession (female Operator CBRN) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Chemical weapons?  Check.  Biological outbreak?  Check.  Nuclear war?  "
"Check.  Sounds like the perfect job for you!"
msgstr "化学武器？打勾。生化疫情？打勾。核战争？打勾。看来你找对工作了！"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rookie"
msgstr "新手"

#. ~ Profession (male Rookie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It's been months since the Cataclysm and somehow you're still greener than a"
" tree.  Maybe you're just a slow learner, who knows."
msgstr "大灾变已经过去几个月了，不知怎么的，你还是刚入门的新手一般。也许你只是学得慢，谁知道呢。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
