msgstr "你学了些炽霜法师的法术来降低冰淇淋车的设备成本。虽然口味变了些，但现在孩子们还是会为你尖叫。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Knife Thrower"
msgstr "飞刀手"

#. ~ Profession (male Knife Thrower) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You entertained the masses, displaying an expert hand tossing knives "
"conjured from nowhere.  Now, you're bringing the show to them."
msgstr "你是娱乐大众的专业表演家，总能变戏法一样从不知何处掷出飞刀，现在到你表演真正的技术的时候了。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Knife Thrower"
msgstr "飞刀手"

#. ~ Profession (female Knife Thrower) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
