msgstr "向上斜坡（底部）"

#. ~ Description for road ramp up (low end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The lower end of an asphalt ramp leading up."
msgstr "一段通往上层的铺了柏油的斜坡底部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "earth ramp down (high end)"
msgstr "向下土坡（顶部）"

#. ~ Description for earth ramp down (high end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The upper end of an earth ramp leading down."
msgstr "一段通往下层的泥土斜坡顶部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "earth ramp down (low end)"
msgstr "向下土坡（底部）"

#. ~ Description for earth ramp down (low end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The lower end of an earth ramp leading down."
msgstr "一段通往下层的泥土斜坡底部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "earth ramp up (high end)"
msgstr "向上土坡（顶部）"

#. ~ Description for earth ramp up (high end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The upper end of an earth ramp leading up."
msgstr "一段通往上层的泥土斜坡顶部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "earth ramp up (low end)"
msgstr "向上土坡（底部）"

#. ~ Description for earth ramp up (low end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The lower end of an earth ramp leading up."
msgstr "一段通往上层的泥土斜坡底部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "sidewalk ramp down (high end)"
msgstr "向下人行道（顶部）"

#. ~ Description for sidewalk ramp down (high end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The upper end of a sidewalk ramp leading down."
msgstr "一段通往下层的人行道顶部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "sidewalk ramp down (low end)"
msgstr "向下人行道（底部）"

#. ~ Description for sidewalk ramp down (low end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The lower end of a sidewalk ramp leading down."
msgstr "一段通往下层的人行道底部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "sidewalk ramp up (high end)"
msgstr "向上人行道（顶部）"

#. ~ Description for sidewalk ramp up (high end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The upper end of a sidewalk ramp leading up."
msgstr "一段通往上层的人行道顶部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "sidewalk ramp up (low end)"
msgstr "向上人行道（底部）"

#. ~ Description for sidewalk ramp up (low end)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "The lower end of a sidewalk ramp leading up."
msgstr "一段通往上层的人行道底部。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "downward slope"
msgstr "向下斜坡"

#. ~ Description for downward slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A downward facing slope."
msgstr "向下的斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "upward slope"
msgstr "向上斜坡"

#. ~ Description for upward slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "An upward facing slope."
msgstr "向上的斜坡。"

#. ~ Description for rope leading up
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A rope.  You could climb up it."
msgstr "一根绳子。你可以爬上去。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "low stairs (beginning section)"
msgstr "低矮的楼梯（起始部分）"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "low stairs (end section)"
msgstr "低矮的楼梯（结束部分）"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "nuclear reactor core"
msgstr "核反应堆核心"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "foamcrete wall"
msgstr "泡沫水泥墙"

#. ~ Description for foamcrete wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lightweight wall made from unreinforced foamcrete.  Not nearly as "
"resilient as a real wall, but it will block sight and the elements "
"nonetheless."
msgstr "用泡沫水泥建成的轻便墙壁。不如一般的墙壁结实，但是仍然能够遮挡视线和天气。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "foamcrete floor"
msgstr "泡沫水泥地板"

#. ~ Description for foamcrete floor
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A relatively flat slab of unreinforced foamcrete."
msgstr "一块较为平坦的未加固泡沫水泥。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "leviathan annelids"
msgstr "巨型环节虫"

#. ~ Description for leviathan annelids
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several massive protrusions emerge from the ground, coiled together into a "
"tower.  At the top, blue and purple tentacles sway in the wind."
msgstr "几个巨大的突出物从地上冒出来，盘绕成一座塔。在顶部，蓝色和紫色的触须在风中摇摆。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "lichen tree"
msgstr "地衣树"

#. ~ Description for lichen tree
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive corrugated body sprouts from the lichen here, branching out into "
"mushroom-like limbs, dust filling the air as the wind meets it."
msgstr "一个巨大的褶皱新芽从这里的苔藓中长出来，分叉成蘑菇状的肢体，当风吹来时，空气中充满了灰尘。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "squish!"
msgstr "嘎吱！"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fossilized conifer"
msgstr "石化针叶树"

#. ~ Description for fossilized conifer
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron."
msgstr "一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "infested fossilized conifer"
msgstr "感染石化针叶树"

#. ~ Description for infested fossilized conifer
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems "
"to be splitting as tendrils of mold dig into it, clinging onto the tree like"
" a frame."
msgstr ""
"一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。树干似乎被深深扎入其中的霉菌触须撑裂开来，这些触须像框架一样紧贴在树上。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "lichen shrub"
msgstr "地衣丛"

#. ~ Description for lichen shrub
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓要大。"

#. ~ Description for lichen shrub
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it.  A few clumps have been removed."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓还要大。一些地衣已被挖开。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "lichen"
msgstr "地衣"

#. ~ Description for lichen
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically "
"fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an "
"aborted terraforming project."
msgstr "许多五颜六色的冰原地衣，在异常肥沃的冰上旺盛生长。可能是本地原生物种，也可能是从某个地质改造工程中幸存下来的基因工程产物。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "splosh."
msgstr "啪叽。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "lichen bed"
msgstr "地衣床"

#. ~ Description for lichen bed
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt"
" here, providing a squishy but colorful grass."
msgstr "地衣和苔藓附着在岩石和死气沉沉的泥土上，提供了一处粘糊糊却色彩丰富的草床，熟悉又陌生。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "glacial ice"
msgstr "冰层"

#. ~ Description for glacial ice
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small segment from the near planet-wide glacier of Salus IV.  Gets called "
"'ground' around these parts."
msgstr "覆盖了近乎整个Salus IV卫星的冰川的一小部分，被称为“地面”，环绕着其他部分。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "哗啦！"

#. ~ Description for dirt
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of black dirt with no observable growth on it, caked "
"with shards of rock.  The only real ground besides the glacial ice."
msgstr "一块相对平坦的黑色泥土区域，上面没有明显的植被，由岩石碎片凝结而成。除了冰层之外唯一的真正的地面。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "basalt floor"
msgstr "玄武岩地面"

#. ~ Description for basalt floor
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A relatively flat area of gray stone, warm to the touch."
msgstr "一片相对平坦的灰色石头区域，触感温暖。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fumarolic ice tower"
msgstr "凝华冰塔"

#. ~ Description for fumarolic ice tower
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。现在它仍然在冒着白气。"

#. ~ Description for fumarolic ice tower
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fumarole"
msgstr "喷气孔"

#. ~ Description for fumarole
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A hole in the ground from which steam and other gases are escaping."
msgstr "地上开了一个洞，蒸汽和其他气体从中逸出。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "snow"
msgstr "积雪"

#. ~ Description for snow
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A patch of thick snow, very cold."
msgstr "一片厚厚的雪地，非常冷。"

#. ~ Description for snow
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A patch of thick snow on top of rocks, very cold."
msgstr "岩石上有一层厚厚的雪，非常冷。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "basalt wall"
msgstr "玄武岩墙"

#. ~ Description for basalt wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A sturdy basalt wall."
msgstr "一堵坚固的玄武岩墙。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "glacial ice wall"
msgstr "冰墙"

#. ~ Description for glacial ice wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A solid wall of glacial ice."
msgstr "一堵冰川冰形成的坚实冰墙。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "snow wall"
msgstr "雪墙"

#. ~ Description for snow wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A solid mass of piled snow."
msgstr "一堵由雪积出的坚实雪墙。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "downward snow slope"
msgstr "向下雪坡"

#. ~ Description for downward snow slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A downward-facing slope of snow."
msgstr "由雪铺成的向下斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "upward snow slope"
msgstr "向上雪坡"

#. ~ Description for upward snow slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "An upward-facing slope of snow."
msgstr "由雪铺成的向上斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "downward glacial ice slope"
msgstr "向下冰坡"

#. ~ Description for downward glacial ice slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A downward-facing glacial slope."
msgstr "由冰铺成的向下斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "upward glacial ice slope"
msgstr "向上冰坡"

#. ~ Description for upward glacial ice slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "An upward-facing glacial slope."
msgstr "由冰铺成的向上斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "downward basalt slope"
msgstr "向下玄武岩坡"

#. ~ Description for downward basalt slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A downward-facing slope of basalt."
msgstr "由玄武岩铺成的向下斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "upward basalt slope"
msgstr "向上玄武岩坡"

#. ~ Description for upward basalt slope
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "An upward-facing slope of basalt."
msgstr "由玄武岩铺成的向上斜坡。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "bleached coral floor"
msgstr "漂白珊瑚地面"

#. ~ Description for bleached coral floor
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small outgrowths of white coral spring from an underlying lattice of black, "
"pulsating veins."
msgstr "从下方蠕动的黑色藤网中长出了小簇白色珊瑚。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "spaceship hull"
msgstr "飞船船体"

#. ~ Description for spaceship hull
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hull segment from a civilian spaceship.  Only sufficiently armored to "
"defend against the vacuum and radiation of space, the only dangers you'd "
"expect to find on the other side."
msgstr "一截民用飞船的船体部分。有着勉强能用来抵御真空和太空辐射的装甲，而位于另一侧的是你不能预见到的唯一危险。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "escape pod guidance system"
msgstr "逃生舱引导系统"

#. ~ Description for escape pod guidance system
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The rudimentary descent guidance system and easy-use control console of an "
"escape pod.  It apparently broke during the descent."
msgstr "逃生舱的基础降落引导系统和易于使用的控制台。显然，它在坠毁时损坏了。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "closed spaceship hatch"
msgstr "飞船舱门（关闭）"

#. ~ Description for closed spaceship hatch
#. ~ Description for open spaceship hatch
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An armored and airtight spaceship hatch.  A side mounted lever allows for "
"its manual operation."
msgstr "一道装甲气密舱门，侧面安装的操作杆允许手动操作。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "open spaceship hatch"
msgstr "飞船舱门（开启）"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "habitat wall"
msgstr "殖民站墙"

#. ~ Description for habitat wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An industrially fabricated assembly of lightweight metallic framing and "
"insulated cover sheets, used to quickly assemble standardized colonial "
"infrastructure.  Capable of resisting the merciless cold and not much else."
msgstr "工业化制造的轻质金属框架和绝缘盖板的组件，用于快速组装标准化的殖民基础设施。 能够抵抗无情的严寒，仅此而已。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "habitat window"
msgstr "殖民站窗"

#. ~ Description for habitat window
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A prefabricated porthole style window, equipped with metallic shutters for "
"both protection and privacy purposes.  It cannot be opened, but with its "
"shutters are retracted, it could be smashed with no particular difficulty."
msgstr "一扇预制舷窗式窗户，装有金属百叶窗以保护隐私。它无法被打开，但百叶窗缩回后，可以被轻易砸碎。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "殖民站窗（关）"

#. ~ Description for habitat window (shutters)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A porthole style window of standard design, completely covered by sturdy "
"metallic shutters."
msgstr "一扇预制舷窗式窗户，完全被坚固的金属百叶窗覆盖。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "殖民站窗（关）（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for broken habitat window (shutters)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shutters of this porthole are deployed, but the lack of a window between"
" them allows the frozen air to leak into the room."
msgstr "这个舷窗的百叶窗被金属百叶窗覆盖着，但是它们之间缺少一扇窗户，使得冰冻的空气泄漏到房间里。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken habitat window"
msgstr "殖民站窗（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for broken habitat window
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The glass panel that would have covered this porthole has been broken, "
"allowing unfettered access to the rooms within."
msgstr "原本覆盖舷窗的玻璃已经破损，使得冰冷的空气可以自由出入房间。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken habitat segment"
msgstr "殖民站墙（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for broken habitat segment
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Exposed structural ribs and battered plate metal are all what remains of "
"this habitat segment."
msgstr "裸露的结构肋骨和倾斜的金属板是这个殖民站仅存的残骸。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "stick wall"
msgstr "简易墙"

#. ~ Description for stick wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cheap mish mash of planks and sticks with a log pillar that keeps it "
"together.  It is capable of supporting an upper level or roof.  Dirt and "
"stones make the wall secure.  Somewhat flammable."
msgstr "一堵用原木柱支撑起来的木板木棍混合墙，相当简陋。它能支撑上层楼或屋顶。泥土和石头使得它比较牢固。有些易燃。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "krick!"
msgstr "咔嚓！"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Edison generator"
msgstr "爱迪生发电机"

#. ~ Description for Edison generator
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This imposing apparatus harnesses 'atmospheric charges', or at least thats "
"what the news said when these things came out.  Pioneered by Elton Moosek "
"and his Bluebox team, these were immediately snapped up by the government "
"due to their potential to generate near limitless power.  It's not doing "
"much good here though.  Perhaps it could be salvaged for other purposes."
msgstr ""
"一台能够利用“空气电荷”的强大设备，至少新闻是这么说的。由埃尔顿·莫塞克（Elton "
"Moosek）和他的\"蓝牛计划\"团队出品，由于有可能产生近乎无限的电力，立即被联邦政府抢购一空。但现在它留在这里什么用也没有。也许可以拆开它回收一些部件。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "burnt tree"
msgstr "烧焦的树"

#. ~ Description for burnt tree
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This tree looks like it has been burnt badly, but it is somehow still "
"standing."
msgstr "这棵树看上去已经被完全烧焦了，但不知怎的，它仍然屹立不倒。"

#. ~ Description for burnt tree
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a large coccoon-like object that looks to be the vague shape of some"
" creature.  You don't want to know how long it stayed alive while being "
"sucked dry by these spiders."
msgstr "这像是一个巨大的茧，看起来像某种生物的形状。你不想去想那个生物在被这些蜘蛛活活吸干之前活了多久。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "webbing wall"
msgstr "蛛网墙"

#. ~ Description for webbing wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, "
"detritus, and some kind of dark-colored resin."
msgstr "这面墙似乎是由蛛网、木头碎片、碎石和某种深色树脂组合而成。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "barren dirt"
msgstr "贫瘠土地"

#. ~ Description for barren dirt
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  The ground here is infertile.  Could also be dug out for "
"construction projects."
msgstr "泥土地，看来土壤十分贫瘠。也可以用来进行建设项目。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "glassteel vault wall"
msgstr "玻璃钢保险墙"

#. ~ Description for glassteel vault wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A barrier made of glassteel, it's nothing complicated, and looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile and it's probably alarmed in the"
" event that someone does break through it."
msgstr "玻璃钢制成的屏障，看起来简单而脆弱。但它肯定一点都不脆弱，而且很可能安装了报警装置，一旦破碎就会被触发。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "a cross between steel bending and glass shattering!"
msgstr "金属弯曲和玻璃破碎声！"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgstr "混凝土地板，永恒烛台"

#. ~ Description for concrete floor, everburning chandelier
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with an elaborate chandelier above it filled "
"with everburning candles."
msgstr "一片冰冷而平凡的混凝土地板，其上的天花板有一盏永恒烛台。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgstr "魔法加强混凝土墙"

#. ~ Description for magically reinforced concrete wall
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient wall, filled with concrete and rebar and esoteric "
"ingredients.  Best suited for supporting multi-level buildings, only serious"
" explosives and high-speed impacts would be capable of damaging this wall."
msgstr "一堵填满钢筋水泥和魔法材料的坚韧墙壁。极适合支持多层建筑，只有烈性爆炸物和高速撞击才能破坏这堵墙。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgstr "魔法加强混凝土地板"

#. ~ Description for magically reinforced concrete floor
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"alchemical concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As "
"for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may "
"very well cave in."
msgstr "由精心架设的钢筋和魔法材料浇筑混凝土制成的强韧地板，能够提供对自然环境的防护。匹配的屋顶仍然需要支撑墙，否则它可能会崩塌。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "vault vent"
msgstr "避难所通风口"

#. ~ Description for vault vent
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This concrete flooring has a vent pouring fresh, clean air into the vault."
msgstr "这块混凝土天花板上有个通风口，不断向避难所中注入新鲜干净的空气。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "electro furnace"
msgstr "电炉"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "industrial drill"
msgstr "工业钻机"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "heavy pipe"
msgstr "重型钢管"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "knock!"
msgstr "咚！"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "thud thud."
msgstr "砰砰。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "knock knock."
msgstr "咚咚。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "open secret"
msgstr "打开密道"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "book case"
msgstr "书柜"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "unusual book case"
msgstr "奇怪的书柜"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "open sliding wall"
msgstr "打开墙壁"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "unusual statue"
msgstr "奇怪的雕像"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "containment manual override"
msgstr "隔离区手动超越控制"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "security bolt release"
msgstr "安防卡榫"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "bridge control"
msgstr "桥梁控制台"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "shallow chocolate"
msgstr "浅巧克力池"

#. ~ Description for shallow chocolate
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chocolate isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be tasty."
msgstr "这里的巧克力不太深。有水密容器的话，可以从这里收集纯的液态可可。这不会很好吃。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "deep chocolate"
msgstr "深巧克力池"

#. ~ Description for deep chocolate
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chocolate here is deep enough to drown in.  With a watertight container,"
" you could gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be "
"tasty."
msgstr "这里的巧克力深度足以使人溺水。有水密容器的话，可以从这里收集纯的液态可可。这不会很好吃。"

#. ~ Description for caramel
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten caramel.  In some "
"places, caramel coated fruit is a delicacy."
msgstr "炽热、灼亮的液体，由熔融的焦糖组成。在某些地方，焦糖涂层的水果可是美味佳肴。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "鸣沙"

#. ~ Description for singing sand
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "一种含有特殊矿物的沙子的形成，当踩在风上或从风中发出口哨声。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "outcrop"
msgstr "露岩"

#. ~ Description for outcrop
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "从周围地形中突出来的各种大而尖的岩石。可以作为很多东西的表面，如果穿着合适的鞋子，也可以爬上去。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "dune"
msgstr "沙丘"

#. ~ Description for dune
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will"
" be troublesome."
msgstr "一个巨大的沙丘，被风不断地重塑。很难爬上去。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "岩漠"

#. ~ Description for desert pavement
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right "
"footwear."
msgstr "它不是一种人工路面！由密集的天然空腔碎岩石组成，比沙漠更容易穿行，只要穿着合适的鞋子。"

#. ~ Description for scorched earth
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting"
" anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "龟裂的土地，看起来不像是可以支撑什么东西。"

#. ~ Description for cactus
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A tall cactus."
msgstr "一个高大的仙人掌。"

