msgstr "带着一些物品归来……"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "returns from your farm with something…"
msgstr "带着一些物品从农场归来……"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "returns from your kitchen with something…"
msgstr "带着一些物品从厨房归来……"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "returns from your blacksmith shop with something…"
msgstr "带着一些物品从铁匠铺归来……"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "You don't have enough food stored to feed your companion."
msgstr "你需要为你的同伴提供更多的食物补给。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "begins to upgrade the camp…"
msgstr "开始升级营地……"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "You don't have the materials for the upgrade."
msgstr "你需要更多的物资才能够升级营地。"

