#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show gun brand names"
msgstr "显示枪械型号"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Show brand names for guns, intead of generic functional names - 'm4a1' or "
"'h&k416a5' instead of 'NATO assault rifle'."
msgstr "显示枪械的具体型号，而非通用枪械名称 - “M4A1 卡宾枪”或“h&k 416a5 步枪”而非“北约突击步枪”。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Add ammo to weapon/magazine names"
msgstr "在武器/弹匣名称中添加弹药名"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, the default ammo is added to weapon and magazine names.  For "
"example \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5)\" becomes \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5 "
"7.62x54mm)\"."
msgstr ""
"开启后，武器/弹匣所使用的默认弹药将添加到其显示名称之中。例如，\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5）\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5 "
"7.62x54mm 弹）\"。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use key code input mode"
msgstr "使用按键码输入模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Use key code or symbol input on SDL.  Symbol is recommended for non-qwerty "
"layouts since currently the default keybindings for key code mode only "
"supports qwerty.  Key code is currently WIP and bypasses IMEs, caps lock, "
"and num lock."
msgstr ""
"使用按键码或符号输入模式。对于非QWERTY键盘，建议使用符号模式，因为按键码模式的按键设置目前仅支持QWERTY键盘。按键码模式仍在开发中，可以绕过输入法、大写锁定和小键盘数字锁定。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Key code"
msgstr "按键码"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Force capital/modified letters in prompts"
msgstr "仅用大写字母/带修饰键输入确认"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, prompts such as Y/N queries only accepts capital or modified "
"letters, while lower case and unmodified letters only snap the cursor to the"
" corresponding option."
msgstr "开启后，确认按键例如Y/N将仅接受大写字母或带修饰键的输入，小写字母或不带修饰键的输入仅将光标移动至对应选项上。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Snap to target"
msgstr "自动锁定目标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, automatically follow the crosshair when firing/throwing."
msgstr "开启后，射击/投掷时将会自动锁定目标。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Query on disassembly while butchering"
msgstr "屠宰拆解前确认"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will query before disassembling items while butchering."
msgstr "开启后，通过屠宰按键拆解物品时需要确认。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Query on keybinding removal"
msgstr "移除快捷键前询问"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will query before removing a keybinding from a hotkey."
msgstr "开启后，移除已有快捷键时需要确认。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Close advanced inventory on move all"
msgstr "移动所有物品后关闭高级物品管理菜单"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, will close the advanced inventory when the move all items command "
"is used."
msgstr "开启后，使用\"移动所有物品\"指令后自动关闭高级物品管理菜单。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout"
msgstr "打开高级物品管理默认布局"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout instead of last opened layout"
msgstr "采用默认布局打开高级物品管理页面"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display actions in Use Item menu"
msgstr "在使用物品菜单中显示可用操作"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, actions ( like \"Read\", \"Smoke\", \"Wrap tighter\" ) will be "
"displayed next to the corresponding items."
msgstr "开启后，可执行的操作（如阅读、消耗、系紧等）会在物品信息栏一旁列出。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Autoselect if exactly one valid target"
msgstr "自动选择唯一目标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, directional actions ( like \"Examine\", \"Open\", \"Pickup\" ) will"
" autoselect an adjacent tile if there is exactly one valid target."
msgstr "开启后，需要指定方向的行动（如查看、开启、拾取等）会在只有唯一有效目标时自动选择方向。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Inventory highlight mode"
msgstr "物品栏高亮模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Highlight selected item's contents and parent container in inventory screen."
"  \"Symbol\" shows a highlighted caret and \"Highlight\" uses font "
"highlighting."
msgstr "在物品栏中高亮突出显示所选物品的内容和上级容器。\"符号\"使用高亮符号，\"高亮\"使用高亮字体。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Highlight"
msgstr "高亮"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Disable"
msgstr "关"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Diagonal movement with cursor keys and modifiers"
msgstr "斜向移动组合键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Allows diagonal movement with cursor keys using CTRL and SHIFT modifiers.  "
"Diagonal movement action keys are taken from keybindings, so you need these "
"to be configured."
msgstr "方向键与CTRL和SHIFT组合按下时可以斜向移动，斜向移动将使用按键设置中对应的斜向移动案件，因此需要在按键设置中提前配置完成。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 1: Numpad Emulation"
msgstr "模式1：小键盘仿真（Ctrl长按设置偏移方向，松开Ctrl+移动键）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 2: CW/CCW"
msgstr "模式2：Shift右旋/Ctrl左旋"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 3: L/R Tilt"
msgstr "模式3：左/右键斜向（Shift向上偏移/Ctrl向下偏移）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vehicle plating changes part color"
msgstr "载具颜色随装甲改变"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, vehicle parts will change color if they are armor plated"
msgstr "开启时，车载部件在安装装甲之后会改变颜色。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto-shift the view while driving"
msgstr "自动调整驾驶视野"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, view will automatically shift towards the driving direction"
msgstr "开启后，驾驶视野会根据驾驶方向自动调整。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Draw vehicle facing indicator"
msgstr "绘制车辆方向指示器"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, when controlling a vehicle, a white 'X' ( in curses version ) or a "
"crosshair ( in tiles version ) at distance 10 from the center will display "
"its current facing."
msgstr "开启后，在玩家控制车辆时，当前车辆的车头朝向会以一个白色的\"X\"（图像版中为十字）标识于离车辆中心的距离10格的位置。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Reverse steering direction in reverse"
msgstr "真实倒车转向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, when driving a vehicle in reverse, steering should also reverse "
"like real life."
msgstr "开启后，当倒车时，转向也会像现实中一样颠倒过来。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sidebar position"
msgstr "侧边栏位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Switch between sidebar on the left or on the right side.  Requires restart."
msgstr "切换侧边栏为左侧或右侧。需要重启。"

#. ~ sidebar position
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Draw sidebar spacers"
msgstr "侧边栏间隔"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, adds an extra space between sidebar panels."
msgstr "开启后，将在侧边栏不同面板之间添加额外空行。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Message log flow"
msgstr "信息记录出现位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Where new log messages should show."
msgstr "设置新的信息记录在哪里出现。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

#. ~ sidebar/message log flow direction
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

