msgid "Sidebar log message display duration"
msgstr "侧边栏日志信息显示时间"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Number of turns after which a message will be removed from the sidebar log."
"  '0' disables this option."
msgstr "侧边栏日志信息在删除前保留的回合数。设为\"0\"将禁用该选项。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Message cooldown"
msgstr "消息冷却时间"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Number of turns during which similar messages are hidden.  '0' disables this"
" option."
msgstr "侧边栏日志中隐藏同类型消息的回合数。设置为0时禁用该选项。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Limit message history"
msgstr "限制信息记录"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Number of messages to preserve in the history, and when saving."
msgstr "查看历史以及保存存档时保存的信息数目。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Suppress \"unknown command\" messages"
msgstr "阻止\"未知指令\"消息"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, pressing a key with no set function will not display a notice in "
"the chat log."
msgstr "开启时，按下未绑定功能的按键将不会在消息栏中显示未知指令的通知。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Popup window when achievement completed"
msgstr "当成就达成时弹出窗口"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Whether to trigger a popup window when completing an achievement.  First: "
"when completing an achievement that has not been completed in a previous "
"game."
msgstr "达成成就时是否显示弹窗。首次：当完成从未在游戏中完成的成就时弹出窗口。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "First"
msgstr "首次"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Look around position"
msgstr "观察面板位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Switch between look around panel being left or right."
msgstr "切换观察面板至左侧或右侧。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pickup position"
msgstr "拾取菜单位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Switch between pickup panel being left, right, or overlapping the sidebar."
msgstr "选择拾取菜单的位置：左方，右方，或者覆盖边栏。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overlapping"
msgstr "覆盖"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Aim window display style"
msgstr "瞄准窗口显示模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "How should confidence and steadiness be communicated to the player."
msgstr "调整射击窗口内命中率及稳定度数值的显示模式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "棒形"

#. ~ aim bar style - bars or numbers
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "数字"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Morale style"
msgstr "心情显示"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Morale display style in sidebar."
msgstr "心情图标在侧边栏处的显示形式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "横向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "纵向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Full screen Advanced Inventory Manager"
msgstr "全屏高级物品管理菜单"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, Advanced Inventory Manager menu will fit full screen, otherwise it "
"will leave sidebar visible."
msgstr "开启后，高级物品管理菜单将全屏显示，否则将保持侧边栏可见。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move view offset"
msgstr "视角画面移动步长"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move view by how many squares per keypress."
msgstr "在移动当前视角画面时每次按键所移动的方格数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap fast scroll offset"
msgstr "大地图快速滚动偏移量"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"With Fast Scroll option enabled, shift view on the overmap and while looking"
" around by this many squares per keypress."
msgstr "在启用快速滚动选项的情况下，在大地图上移动视图，每次按键移动多少格。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Centered menu scrolling"
msgstr "菜单滚动条居中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, menus will start scrolling in the center of the list, and keep the "
"list centered."
msgstr "开启后，滚动条将在列表的中间位置开始滚动，并一直保持列表居中。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shift list item view"
msgstr "查看物品时画面移动方式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Centered or to edge, shift the view toward the selected item if it is "
"outside of your current viewport."
msgstr "当所选物品超出当前画面范围时，将会移动视角画面使得所选物品居中或位于画面边缘。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "居中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "To edge"
msgstr "边缘"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto inventory letters"
msgstr "自动分配物品快捷字符"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Enabled: automatically assign letters to any carried items that lack them.  "
"Disabled: do not auto-assign letters.  Favorites: only auto-assign letters "
"to favorited items."
msgstr "启用：自动分配字母。禁用：不自动分配字母。收藏：仅为收藏的物品自动分配字母。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "收藏"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show item health bars"
msgstr "显示物品耐久条"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, show item health bars instead of reinforced, scratched etc. text."
msgstr "开启时，将使用棒状显示条替代物品耐久度的文字描述。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show item symbols"
msgstr "显示物品符号"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, show item symbols in inventory and pick up menu."
msgstr "选择是，物品的符号将显示在物品菜单和拾取菜单中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable joystick"
msgstr "启用游戏手柄"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable input from joystick."
msgstr "启用对手柄、摇杆输入的支持。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Hide mouse cursor"
msgstr "隐藏鼠标光标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Show: Cursor is always shown.  Hide: Cursor is hidden.  HideKB: Cursor is "
"hidden on keyboard input and unhidden on mouse movement."
msgstr "显示：鼠标总是显示。隐藏：鼠标总是隐藏。按键时隐藏：使用键盘时鼠标隐藏。"

#. ~ show mouse cursor
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#. ~ hide mouse cursor
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#. ~ hide mouse cursor when keyboard is used
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "HideKB"
msgstr "按键时隐藏"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Edge scrolling"
msgstr "边缘滚动"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Edge scrolling with the mouse."
msgstr "鼠标移动至窗口边缘时滚动屏幕。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display enabled animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示下列被启用的动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Rain animation"
msgstr "下雨动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display weather animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示天气动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Projectile animation"
msgstr "投射物动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, will display animations for projectiles like bullets, arrows, and "
"thrown items."
msgstr "开启后，将会显示投射物的动画，如子弹、弓箭和投掷物。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "SCT animation"
msgstr "战斗气泡动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display scrolling combat text animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示战斗气泡动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "SCT with Unicode font"
msgstr "战斗气泡动画使用Unicode"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display scrolling combat text with Unicode font."
msgstr "开启后，战斗气泡动画将使用Unicode字符而非贴图包。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Animation delay"
msgstr "动画延时"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The amount of time to pause between animation frames in ms."
msgstr "每帧动画之间的延迟时间。以毫秒为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Force redraw"
msgstr "强制重新渲染"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, forces the game to redraw at least once per turn."
msgstr "开启时，则游戏会在每个回合强制重新渲染。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use seasonal title screen"
msgstr "使用季节标题画面"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, the title screen will use the art appropriate for the season."
msgstr "开启时，标题画面将随季节变化。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Alternative title screen frequency"
msgstr "特殊标题画面频率"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the probability of the alternate title screen appearing."
msgstr "设置特殊标题画面出现的频率。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Terminal width"
msgstr "终端宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the size of the terminal along the X axis."
msgstr "设置窗口的宽度（X方向）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Terminal height"
msgstr "终端高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the size of the terminal along the Y axis."
msgstr "设置窗口的高度（Y方向）。"

#: src/options.cpp
